  <scopecontent id="885bada372e99e75d904131e9c8e7c88">
    <head>Scope and Contents</head>
<p>Christopher Wright served on the Rockefeller Foundation staff in Natural and Environmental Science from 1972-1975. The Wright papers primarily document his work on the Hudson River Basin Project. The collection is comprised of project proposals, reports, papers and documentation of conferences and presentations, correspondence and memoranda, trip reports, meeting records, diary entries and notes, project and program evaluations, and analyis.</p>  </scopecontent>
  <acqinfo id="cbdb04f8fb1b3bb4a0d0e831776c0920">
    <head>Immediate Source of Acquisition</head>
<p>The Christopher Wright papers were donated to the RAC as an unrestricted gift in 2025 by the Wright family.</p>  </acqinfo>
